{
  "_": [
    "Regression pass, media over a DM between two throwaway peers (a sends, b receives).",
    "a and b become friends (b asks, a accepts on the Requests tab), then a sends four files:",
    "(a) a small mp4: b's bubble turns playable on its own (default threshold 169 MB) and",
    "    its player initialises (video_state reads the VideoPlayer controller).",
    "(b) the auto-download gate (#41): b turns 'Download automatically' to Off. The slider's",
    "    only values are Off or 34 to 2048 MB, so Off is the one setting that holds back a",
    "    6 MiB file. a sends regress_gate_6mb.bin; b's card must still offer its Download",
    "    control after 10 s, and completes once b taps it (completed = the card's plain size",
    "    line, '6.0 MB' and the extension, with no Download control and no progress text).",
    "(c) a 40 MiB file, over the 34 MiB direct cap (kLargeFileThresholdBytes, Dart; the",
    "    Rust twin DEFAULT_MAX_FILE_SIZE), so a confirms 'Send as Share' and it rides the",
    "    Hollow Share data-channel lane. With the gate Off b downloads it by hand, and it",
    "    has to complete. A DM share looks unable to auto-start at all (event_provider gates",
    "    the auto-start on _serverSyncDone, keyed by server id, which a DM never stamps), so",
    "    this journey does not test the auto-start; the channel path is where it lives.",
    "(d) a voice note: the probe cannot record, but a file named exactly 'Voice message.ogg'",
    "    attached to the composer is sent with the voice flag, the same as the recorder's.",
    "    With the gate still Off it must arrive on its own (voice notes are exempt) and play",
    "    (audio_state sees the position advance).",
    "",
    "Fixtures: run `python scripts/make_regress_fixtures.py` first (build/regress_fixtures).",
    "The repo path must not contain 'temp': the DM send deletes a sent .ogg whose path does.",
    "Run on FRESH fixtures, never -Attach: the friendship and the file names are not per run.",
    "Cleanup puts b's threshold back near the default (164 MB, the nearest slider step to",
    "169) and removes the friendship from a's Friends tab (More for probe-b, Remove friend).",
    "",
    "run: powershell -File scripts/fleet.ps1 -Scenario regress_media -Peers a,b -StepTimeoutSeconds 300"
  ],
  "peers": ["a", "b"],
  "steps": [
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait_for", "provider": "connection", "equals": "connected", "timeout_ms": 120000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "capture", "from": "provider", "key": "peerId", "as": "PEER_A" },

    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "friends first: b sends the request, a accepts it on the Requests tab" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "enter_text", "target": "hint:Paste an ID, or type a nickname", "value": "${PEER_A}" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:Send request", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:Accept friend request", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Accept friend request", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:probe-b", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:probe-a", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:probe-b", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:probe-a", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait", "ms": 1500 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "(a) a video: b's bubble turns playable and its player initialises" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "attach_file", "path": "${REPO}/build/regress_fixtures/regress_clip.mp4" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "index": 0, "value": "clip ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "key", "value": "enter" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:clip ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:VideoMessageBubble", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:clip ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 90000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "the bubble is labelled Play only once the bytes are on disk; before that it says Download" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:Play regress_clip.mp4", "timeout_ms": 120000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Play regress_clip.mp4", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "video_state", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "video_state", "timeout_ms": 5000 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "shot", "name": "media-01-video" },

    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "(b) the auto-download gate: b turns Download automatically to Off" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Settings", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:SettingsPlace", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:SettingsPlace > text:Files & storage", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_AutoDownloadSlider", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "reveal", "target": "type:_AutoDownloadSlider" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "a tap at the slider's left end lands below 34 MB, which the row snaps to Off" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap_at", "of": "type:_AutoDownloadSlider > type:Slider", "align": "centerLeft", "dx": 2 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_AutoDownloadSlider > text:Off", "timeout_ms": 5000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "shot", "name": "media-02-gate-off" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Close settings", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:SettingsPlace", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:probe-a", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait", "ms": 3000 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "attach_file", "path": "${REPO}/build/regress_fixtures/regress_gate_6mb.bin" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "index": 0, "value": "gate ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "key", "value": "enter" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:gate ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:gate ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 90000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:Download regress_gate_6mb.bin", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "10 s with the card on screen: it must still be waiting for a click, not downloading" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait", "ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:Download regress_gate_6mb.bin", "timeout_ms": 2000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "expect_no_text", "value": "Downloading... 6.0 MB" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "expect_no_text", "value": "/ 6.0 MB" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "shot", "name": "media-03-gate-held" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Download regress_gate_6mb.bin", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "semantics:Download regress_gate_6mb.bin", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "complete = the plain size line with no Download control (in flight it reads 'x MB / 6.0 MB')" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:6.0 MB · .bin", "timeout_ms": 150000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "expect_count", "target": "semantics:Download regress_gate_6mb.bin", "value": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "shot", "name": "media-04-gate-done" },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "(c) 40 MiB, over the 34 MiB direct cap: a Hollow Share on the data-channel lane" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "attach_file", "path": "${REPO}/build/regress_fixtures/regress_big_40mb.bin" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "dialog > text:File is large (40 MB)", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "dialog > text:Send as Share", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "dialog", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "index": 0, "value": "big ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "key", "value": "enter" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:big ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:big ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 120000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:Download regress_big_40mb.bin", "timeout_ms": 120000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "shot", "name": "media-05-big-offered" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Download regress_big_40mb.bin", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "semantics:Download regress_big_40mb.bin", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:40.0 MB · .bin", "timeout_ms": 240000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "expect_count", "target": "semantics:Download regress_big_40mb.bin", "value": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "expect_count", "target": "semantics:Retry download of regress_big_40mb.bin", "value": 0 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "shot", "name": "media-06-big-done" },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "(d) a voice note, with the gate still Off: it must arrive on its own and play" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "attach_file", "path": "${REPO}/build/regress_fixtures/Voice message.ogg" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "index": 0, "value": "voice ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "key", "value": "enter" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:voice ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:voice ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 90000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:Play Voice message.ogg", "timeout_ms": 90000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "expect_count", "target": "semantics:Download Voice message.ogg", "value": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "the row is labelled Play while it downloads too (disabled), so let the bytes land first" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "contains:Downloading...", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait", "ms": 3000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Play Voice message.ogg", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "audio_state", "timeout_ms": 20000 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "shot", "name": "media-07-voice" },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "dump", "name": "regress-media" }
  ],
  "cleanup": [
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "b's threshold back near the default: the slider's nearest step to 169 MB is 164 MB" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Close settings", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Settings", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:SettingsPlace > text:Files & storage", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "reveal", "target": "type:_AutoDownloadSlider", "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap_at", "of": "type:_AutoDownloadSlider > type:Slider", "align": "centerLeft", "dx": 26, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_AutoDownloadSlider > text:164 MB", "timeout_ms": 5000, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Close settings", "index": 0, "soft": true },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "the friendship goes from a's Friends tab: More for probe-b, then Remove friend, which asks first" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Friends", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:More for probe-b", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:More for probe-b", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "menu > text:Remove friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "dialog > text:Remove friend", "timeout_ms": 5000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "dialog > text:Remove friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:No friends yet", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:No friends yet", "timeout_ms": 90000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0, "soft": true }
  ]
}
